1,Sotho language - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sotho_language,"Sotho is a Southern Bantu language, belonging to the Niger–Congo language family, and is in the Sotho–Tswana branch of Zone S (S.30). ""Sotho"" is also the name given to the entire Sotho-Tswana group, in which case Sesotho proper is called ""Southern Sotho"".","Sotho, Northern",Niger-Congo
